\id NUM Are portions [mwc] -Papua New Guinea (DBL 2017) 
\h Nambas 
\toc1 NAMBAS Kupuramom maranai 
\toc2 Nambas 
\mt1 NAMBAS  
\mt2 Kupuramom maranai  
\is1 Wonaberena  
\ip Niko buka nambas kana waba si berei basuna kapita asi 4 dagudagunai wai Israel sebasebare abiabiyisi asi koroto biyamo Israel damna 12 ba rakarakana kamosi yai. Niko buka yebo e wonewonita kata Israel biyisi bodu 38 kupuramom kamonai si mamana ba, awaika wata si wosewose, ba mekabage Sainai koyanai si yewo ku Canaan kupurina kana ku biparaparata.  
\c 6  
\s1 Priest asi Bigairena  
\p
\v 22  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i sisiya i wona,  
\v 23 “Israel biyisi nikasike koni gairenisi ba kona wona kurisi,   
\q1
\v 24 ‘\nd Bada\nd*, ini gairenimi,  
\q3 ba ini taraparanimi.   
\q1
\v 25  \nd Bada\nd* naona ina yasegana kurimi  
\q3 ba ana bibaita kurimi ina mana,   
\q1
\v 26  \nd Bada\nd* ina ma karokaronimi  
\q3 ba nuwanuba ina berimi.’   
\p
\v 27 Yauku kau wabai nikasike Israel biyisi kurisi sina wosei wai yauku ikesiku mom ani gairenisi.”   
\c 13  
\s1 Canaan si Nanagi  
\p
\v 1  \nd Bada\nd* i sisiya, Moses kurina,  
\v 2 “Israel biyisi asi dam 12 kamosi yai bibadana kesakesasike ke bineisi, ba ki poraisi Canaan tanona Yauku Israel biyisi a berebereisi wai sina nanagi.”   
\p
\v 3 Kata \nd Bada\nd* i kaotunei wai Moses nanakasike i wosei. Israel asi dam babadisi asi 12 Paran kupura momnai i poraisi si kasibau.   
\b  
\p
\v 17 Maranai Moses i poraisi Canaan sita kita nanagi wai i wona, “Negev kamonai wata ko nae ku sepina ku koya yogiyogisi.  
\v 18 Kupurina ko kita nanagi, pipiya biyamo namai te mamana, ba kosi maragasisi kona mesumesusi.  
\v 19 Tanona ko nanaga kabitamni kata gairena kona goyona. Kwanatusi ko nanaga kata kamagisi kona si gara bibira.  
\v 20 Tanona marimariyina kona gomagomarina. Namai keyama kona kega. Ko wosei rubai kata tano uwana mutusi kona yauna kona veramaga.” (Kona maranai grape menai si dagui.)   
\p
\v 21 Damanina ba si nae ba tano si nanagi, Zin kupura momnai ba si nae ku Rehob, Lebo-Hamat kupurina parinai.   
\s1 Kaunanaga Biyisi si Veramaga  
\p
\v 25 Pipiya kupura si nanagi wai kao 40 murinai si veramaga.  
\v 26 Si veramaga Moses, ba Aaron ba Israel biyisi ereonowasi kurisi Kadesh yai, Paran kupura momna kamonai. Namai ereonowasi kurisi si mamatara ba yebo kupurina uwana si beyisi.  
\v 27 Moses kurina si wona, “Kupurina ka nanagi ba ka panani kata kona marimariyina ba tano gairena, ba nina uwana mutusi.  
\v 28 Saba pipiyisi nai te mamana wai si maragata saki, ba asi meyaga kaikaposi ba asi gari padapadasi. Yebo Anak ana dam namai ka kinanisi. Pipiya kaidagimisi. \fig |alt="1/2 Page" src="bk00362c.tif" size="span" ref="13:28" \fig*  
\v 29 Amalek biyisi Negev kupurinai te mamana, ba Hitti, Jebusi ba Amori biyisi koyai te mamana, ba Canaan enaga parinai ba Jordan okowina parinai te mamana.”   
\p
\v 30 Ba pipiya Moses si msi bibiri wai Caleb i wonisi sita ma guguba ba i wona, “Kota wai rubarubana nokosi pipiya tana getawanisi ba asi tano tana yauni.”   
\p
\v 31 Saba pipiya yabata si gae wai si kaosaira, “Kega, nokosi pipiya si maragata saki, kega rubana kosi yabata tani abiya.”  
\v 32 Kata Israel kamosi yai si kaobimaragwasa, si wona, “Tano ka nanagi wai kega marimariyina ba pipiya nai te mamana wai ini kampariparisi. Pipiya ereonowasi ka kinanisi wai pipiya kaidagimisi.  
\v 33 Nephilim yebo namai ka kitai, kona Anak ana dam.\x * \xo 13:33 \xt Genesis 6:4\x* Ba kurisi wai bage kota sapom rutainisi, ba kinanita kosi kurisi wai kesanina.”   
\c 14  
\s1 Pipiya si Kokona  
\p
\v 1 Kona pomnai pipiya ereonowasi gamosi kaikaponai si tou rasarasa.  
\v 2 Moses ba Aaron kurisi si gwini, si wona, “I gaire kata Egypt yai kata ma mom, kona niko kupura momna kamonai tata rabobo.  
\v 3 Ba awaika kairavina \nd Bada\nd* i yaunita ta nenae niko ku kupura ba abiya kamonai sina kasibunuwanita? Ba kaokaowata ba natunatuta sina patumisi. I gaire kata tata veramaga ku Egypt!”  
\v 4 Ba kosi wata si kaoboneyana, “Kota bada wauna tana binei ba tana veramaga ku Egypt.”   
\p
\v 5 Damanina Moses ba Aaron Israel biyisi ereonowasi si gaenisi wai naosi yai si peku ku tano.  
\v 6 Ba Nun natuna Joshua ba Jephunneh natuna Caleb, kosi yabata tano si nanagi wai, ere yapoyisi kasi gara si sika.  
\v 7 Ba Israel biyisi ereonowasi kurisi si wona, “Nao tano ka yewo ba ka nanagi wai i gaire saki.  
\v 8 Abisiri yai \nd Bada\nd* gwabiti yai wai, ini naovita tana riu nao ku kupura tanona gairena ba mariya bonabonana ina berita.  
\v 9 Kega \nd Bada\nd* kurina koni kawakasekase.\x * \xo 14:9 \xt Hebrews 3:16\x* Ba kega pipiyisi kona nagarisi, rubana tana getawanisi. Kasi abapapara wai kega, ba \nd Bada\nd* wai kota gwabiti yai. Kega kona nagarisi.”   
\p
\v 10 Saba koroto ereonowasi si wona, kata akimai sita kasibunuisi. Saba \nd Bada\nd* ana kadara Tabernacle yai i rerematara Israel biyisi ereonowasi kurisi.   
\cd God Moses i wonei, ke veramaga ba pipiya kuni naovisi ku kupura momna, ketanai ku Enaga Taratarana.  
\s1 Gwini Sarobina  
\p
\v 26 Damanina ba \nd Bada\nd* Moses ba Aaron kurisi i wonisi,  
\v 27 “Meyana nikosi pipiya kaikorotosi, pipiya goyogoyosi, ba kawakasekasesi, kuriku gwini sina boterei! Israel biyisi asi kaogimoto ba gwini a nonori.  
\v 28 Ke wonisi kata, ‘A mamana ba awaika si bisisiyei a nonori wai, nanakasike kurimi ana wosei.  
\v 29 Ereonowami niko kupura momnai, ko gwinigwini kuriku, ba komi iyabomi pipiya baiyavisi maranai si baiyawimi ba kami bodu 20 ba i gae wai kona rabobo.\x * \xo 14:29 \xt Hebrews 3:17\x*  
\v 30 A kaobiyoyobanimi namai kota mana saba kega komi kotoi ina riu, Caleb ba Joshua kosi wata sina riu ku kupurina.   
\p
\v 31 Natunatumi ko wona sina pisikarisi, wai ana yaunisi ana riu kupura koi sinikikiyei wai nakai, ba namai nuwagaire ai sina mana.  
\v 32 Saba komi wai niko kupura momnai kona rabobo.  
\v 33 Ba natunatumi wai sheep aba potapota rutainisi, niko kupura momna kamonai sina bubuwa neubuwa bodu 40 rubana ami nota kabakaba kairavina, yepo ereonowami kona rabobo.   
\p
\v 34 Kao 40 kupura ko nanagi wai nanakasike saroba ana berimi, bodu kesana wai kao kesana rubana. Koi abiyiku wai au damidami kona yauni.  
\v 35 Yauku \nd Bada\nd* a wona, bisuwona nikona ana wosei, niko kaikorotona kuriku si kawakasekase wai, ereonowasi niko kupura momnai sina kakaba. Nina sina rabobo.’”   
\c 20  
\s1 Moses Akima i Ravi  
\p
\v 1 Israel kaikorotona nawaravi dagudagunai si botu Zin ku kupura momna ba Kadesh ai si kwanatu. Ba Miriam i rabobo ba si dogui.   
\s1 Israel Biyisi si Gwini Mena  
\p
\v 2 Ba memena si kwanatu wai okowa kega, ba pipiya si notuwa Moses ba Aaron kurisi\x * \xo 20:2 \xt Exodus 17:1-7\x* ba si gwini,  
\v 3 “I gaire kata warewaresita \nd Bada\nd* ana Tabernacle naonai si rabobo wai yabata tata rabobo.  
\v 4 Awaika kairavina \nd Bada\nd* ana pipiya kaikorotona ku botuvisi niko ku kupura momna kata nina ama abapayapayaya yabata kana rabobo?  
\v 5 Awaika kairavina kom ku wosei wai Egypt ka kasibau taveyei niko ku kupura goyo tavetaveyina? Memena grain kega, fig kega, grape vine ba pomegranate kega ba yebo toma kairavina wai okowa kega!”   
\p
\v 6 Ba Moses ba Aaron pipiya dugu kaikorotona si sumarisi si nae ku Tabernacle matam ketanai naosi yai si peku ku tano ba \nd Bada\nd* ana kadara i rerematara kurisi.  
\v 7  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona,  
\v 8 “Am ruwakuna ke yauni ba kom ba tuwateim Aaron pipiya koi runotuwanisi ba matasi yai ki sisiya nao ku akima ba okowa ina busira ina kasibau, kom okowa akima kamonai kuna yore kasibauwei wai pipiya kaikorotosi asi aba payapayaya yabata sina toma.”  
\v 9 Kata ruwakuna \nd Bada\nd* matanai i yauni, i kaotunei wai nanakasike.   
\s1 Moses Akima i Ravi  
\p
\v 10 Moses ba Aaron pipiya duguna akima naonai si kesanisi ba si wonisi, “Koi tainabaenega, komi kawakasekasemi, kata okowa komi kairavimi niko akima kamonai kani kasibauni kona?”  
\v 11 Damanina ba Moses yarona i bokabari ba ana ruwakunai akima i ravi mara ruwamo. Ba okowa kaikapona i busira i kasibau ba pipiya kaikorotona asi aba payapayaya yabata si toma.   
\p
\v 12 Saba \nd Bada\nd* Moses ba Aaron kurisi i wona, “Kega koi tumaganiku ba au kaobaisiyena Israel biyisi matasi yai kega ko bokuwayiku wai niko dugu kaikorotona kega koni naovisi ku kupura a bereberimi wai nakai.”   
\s1 Aaron i Rabobo  
\p
\v 23 Hor koyanai Edom kana biparaparata gwabinai \nd Bada\nd* Moses ba Aaron kurisi i wona,  
\v 24 “Mara i botu kata Aaron ina rabobo ba nosinosina kurisi ina nae. Ba Israel biyisi tano a berebereisi wai kega nakai ina riu, ba Meribah okowina kairavina ami ruwamo a kaobiyoyobanimi wai koi kasikotobi.  
\v 25 Aaron natuna Eleazar yabata keurabaisi, ko gae ku Hor koyana.  
\v 26 Namai Aaron kana priest garasi ke botaveyei ba natuna Eleazar ki kotei, kairavina Aaron namai ina rabobo ba nosinosina kurisi ina nae.”   
\p
\v 27  \nd Bada\nd* Moses i kaotunei wai, nanakasike i wosei, asi tonu pipiya kaikorotona si kinakinasi ba Hor koyana si gaeni.  
\v 28 Moses Aaron kana priest garasi i botavetaveyana ba natuna Eleazar i kotei. Ba Aaron namai koya tepanai i rabobo. Damanina ba Moses ba Eleazar si gakira,  
\v 29 ba pipiya kaikorotona maranai si kuiri kata Aaron i rabobo wai Israel biyisi ereonowasi kao 30 kairavina si tou.   
\c 21  
\s1 Mota Kwari Kadakadarina  
\p
\v 4 Ba Israel biyisi Hor koyanai si tauya si nae Enaga Taratarana parinai wata Edom si yewo bibiri. Saba pipiya si yewo yepo si netotoyana,  
\v 5 ba pipiya God ba Moses si kaosairei, si wona, “Awaika kairavina Egypt yai ku urabai kai ba kupura momnai kana rabobo? Nina wai kam kega ba okowa kega ba niko kam sinikikaiyina kega ama waina!”   
\p
\v 6 Ba \nd Bada\nd* mota gomara rutainisi ku kamosi i poraisi ba pipiya si kanisi wai Israel biyisi pesarisi si rabobo.\x * \xo 21:6 \xt 1 Corinthians 10:9\x*  
\v 7 Ba pipiya si botu Moses kurina ba si wona, “Yakai \nd Bada\nd* ba kom matami yai kai sisiya wai piragagoyo ka wosei. Ke rupari kata \nd Bada\nd* mota kariki yai ina yauna taveyana.” Kata Moses pipiya kairavisi i rupari.   
\p
\v 8  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona, “Mota ke wosei ba ku ariri ke kasiratui ba ki totori. Ba kotoi wata mota ina kani wai, ina gagawa motana ina kinani wai ina yawasa.”  
\v 9 Kata Moses mota kwari kadakadarina i wosei\x * \xo 21:9 \xt 2 Kings 18:4\x* ba ku ariri veoromina i kasiratui ba i totori.\x * \xo 21:9 \xt John 3:14\x* Ba kotoi wata mota i kanikani wai mota kwari kadakadarina i kinakinani wai i yawayawasa.   
\s1 Si Wagawaga ku Moab  
\p
\v 10 Israel biyisi si tauya mena wai Obot yai si kwanatu.  
\v 11 Ba Obot si kasibau taveyei si nae Iye Abarim kupura mom Moab kao e gegae wai namai yebo si kwanatu.  
\v 12 Ba namai si nae ba Zered kawa sanaginai si kwanatu.  
\v 13 Ba namai si nae ba Anon okowina parinai si kwanatu, kona wai kupura momna ba i nae ku Amori kupurina kata Arnon wai Moab ba Amori biyisi asi biparaparata.   
\s1 Sihon ba Og  
\p
\v 21 Ba Israel biyisi kawariyonayona si poraisi Sihon Amori biyisi asi taupauma sita wonei,  
\v 22 “Ke kinana momikai ba am kupura kamonai wata kana nae. Kega kani utusaira ku kwapu kona ku vine baona kona meo doguai okowa kana toma. Ba totorina taupauma ana keta badai ka nenae yepo kani garubona.”   
\p
\v 23 Saba Sihon kega i damanina kata Israel ana kupura kamonai wata sita nae ba ana abiabiyisi ereonowasi i bobunagisi ba i kasibau ku kupura momna Israel ita gebeyesi. Maranai i verakasibau ku Jahaz wai Israel biyisi yabata si rauwa.  
\v 24 Saba Israel biyisi si kasibunuwanisi ba asi tano Anon okowinai ba i nae ku Jabbok Ammon parasina, kairavina asi parata wai gari bibirisi.   
\p
\v 25 Ba Israel biyisi Amori biyisi asi meyaga kaikaposi ereonowasi si yauna si karisi yai Hesbon ba meyaga yogiyogisi yabata.   
\b  
\p
\v 31 Ba Israel biyisi Amori biyisi asi kupurai si mana.   
\s1 Taupauma Og Israel Byisi si ge binubai  
\p
\v 32 Moses nanaga biyisi i poraisi si nae ku Jazer murinai wai Israel biyisi meyaga yogiyogisi kona kupurinai si yauna ba Amori biyisi nai si mamana wai si kwabinisi si kasibau.  
\v 33 Ba si msi taibira ba keta si bonunui si gae ku Bashan, saba Bashan taupaumina Og ana abiabiyisi ereonowasi si kasibau ba Edrei yai si panapanana ba yabata si abiya.  
\v 34  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i sisiya, “Kega kuna nagarei kairavina ana pipiya ereonowasi ba ana tano yabata ku yarom a tereterisi. Mekabage Amori biyisi asi taupauma Sihon Heshbon i bitaupauma wai kurina ku wosei wai kesanina ke wosei kurina.”  
\v 35 Israel biyisi Taupauma Og natunatuta yabata ba ana abiabiyisi ereonowasi si kasibunuwana kega kesana yawayawasina si boterei. Damanina ba Israel biyisi asi tano ereonowana si yauni si karisi yai.   
\c 22  
\s1 Balak Wara i Porai Balaam kurina  
\p
\v 1 Damanina ba Israel biyisi Moab guburinai si wagawaga si nae Jordan okowina parina si kwanatu ba sepinai wai Jericho.  
\v 2 Kata Zippor natuna Balak awaika Israel biyisi Amori biyisi kurisi si wosei wai i kinana roboi.  
\v 3 Moab biyisi Israel asi koroto si kinani wai si nagara saburere bisuwona Moab biyisi nagara i bobunuisi.  
\v 4 Ba Moab biyisi Midian warawaraetesi kurisi si wona, “Niko koroto kaikapo wawasi sina bomsiri wai bull mekabage gwanewa te kanikani wai nanakasike sina kam pupuna taveyei.”  
\p Kona maranai wai Moab biyisi asi taupauma Balak,  
\v 5 kawariyonayona i porai si nae Beor natuna Balaam ana kupura Pethor okowa parinai i mamana wai si yorei. Balak i wona, “Dam Egypt yai si verakasibau ba dobu si bonuwei ba gwabiku ai si kwanatu.  
\v 6 Karaku ke botu nikosi pipiya kuna kaonawaisi kairavina kosi kuriku wai si maragata saki. Memena bage ana getawanisi ba niko kupurai ana kwabina taveyisi. Kairavina a kuiri kata kosi ke bigairenisi wai bibigairenisi ba pipiya ke kaonawaisi wai te paipaiwara.”   
\p
\v 7 Moab biyisi ba Midian biyisi asi warawaraetesi si kawa wai suwarina si yauni ba si tauya Balaam kurina ba Balak awaika i wonei wai, si karaberei.  
\v 8 Balaam kurisi i wona, “Niko pomnai kau kupama kona terei, ba \nd Bada\nd* mekabage ina kaobeyiku wai ana wonimi.” Kata Moab babadisi yabata si mana ba si dauwa.   
\p
\v 9 Ba God i botu Balaam kurina ba i wona, “Mekosi pipiya yabata ko mamana?”   
\p
\v 10 Balaam God kurina i wona, “Moab biyisi asi taupauma Zippor natuna Balak niko wara i porai kuriku.  
\v 11 ‘Dam Egypt yai si verakasibau ba dobu si bonuwei. Karaku ke botu kairaviku kuna kaonawaisi. Memena bage karaku mosi animsi beyisi ba niko kupurai ana kwabinisi sina kasibau.’”   
\p
\v 12 Saba God Balaam i wonei, “Kega yabata kona nae. Ba kega kuna kaonawaisi kairavina Yauku, ai gairenisi.”   
\p
\v 13 Balaam didibarai i bomsiri ba Balak ana babadisi i wonisi, “Ko veramaga ami ku kupura kairavina \nd Bada\nd* i gesiku kega yabata tana nae.”   
\p
\v 14 Ba Kata Moab babadisi si veramaga Balak kurina ba si wona, “Balaam i totoyana wai kega yabata ka botu.”   
\b  
\cd Kata Balak babadisi damana i porasi Balaam kurina. Ba i wonei kata iti maisa sakiyei maranai ita nae ba Israel biyisi ita kaonawaisi. Saba niko maranai wai God, Balaam i wonei kata pipiyisi yabata sita nae Balak kurina ba God awaika ita wonei wai nanakasike ita wosei.  
\s1 Balaam ana Donkey  
\p
\v 21 Ba Balaam didibarai i bomsiri ba ana donkey i bobunagi ba Moab babadisi damana yabata si nae.  
\v 22 God wai i yagisi saki maranai Balaam ana ku donkey i geru ba ana saibisaibirisi ruwamo yabata si nenae, wai \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya ana ketai i msiri kata ita gebeyei.\x * \xo 22:22 \xt Jude 1:11\x*  
\v 23 Balaam ana donkey aneya i kinani seri yaronai ba ketai i msiri wai i utusaira ku kwapu. Balaam donkey i ravi ba i taina bibiri ku keta.  
\v 24 Damanina ba \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya vine baosi ruwamo garisi basusi yai keta kiudunai i msiri.  
\v 25 Maranai donkey \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya i kinani wai ku gara i ratu ba kaena iuna raturatui wai yebo ba i ravi meyei.  
\v 26 Damanina ba \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya yogina i nae ba keta kiudunai i msiri kega rubana ku geduna kona kasuna itimsi taibira.  
\v 27 Maranai donkey \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya i kinai wai Balaam tepanai ba i kenokira kata Balaam i yagisi ba donkeyna ana ruwakunai i ravi.  
\v 28 Ba \nd Bada\nd* donkey kawana i botatari ba Balaam kurina i sisiya, “Awaika a wosei kurim wai mara tonu ku raviku?”\x * \xo 22:28 \xt 2 Peter 2:15,16\x*   
\p
\v 29 Balaam donkey i kaobeyei, “Balaam i para, ku wosiku wai kau kinana bage neganega, seri yaroku ai, wai karaku ata kasibunuim!”   
\p
\v 30 Donkey Balaam kurina i wona, “Yauku donkeyna kesanina niko mara veoromina ke gerugeru. Meyana nikasike kurim a wosei kona kega?”  
\p “Kega,” Balaam i wona.   
\p
\v 31 Damanina ba \nd Bada\nd* Balaam matana i botatari ba aneya i kitai ana seri yaronai i bokabari ba keta basunai i bimsiri. Kata gayamina i tere kirei ba i peku ku tano.  
\v 32  \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya i toirubai, “Awaika kairavina am donkey nikosi mara tonu ku ravi? Yauku a botu am keta ata gudui kairavina am wagawaga kuriku kega gairena.  
\v 33 Ba donkey i kitaiku wai nikosi mara tonu i utusaira ba kega wai karaku ata kasibunuim ba donkey ita mana.”   
\p
\v 34 Damanina ba Balaam \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya i wonei, “Yauku piragagoyo a wosei, kega a kuiri kata ketai ku bimsiri kata kuti gesiku. Kega ke binuwagaire wai kata ana veramaga.”   
\p
\v 35  \nd Bada\nd* ana aneya Balaam i wonei, “Nikosi pipiya yabata ko nae saba, awaika ana wonim wai kona, wata ki sisiyei.” Damanina ba Balaam, Balak ana babadisi damana yabata si nae.   
\b  
\c 23  
\p
\v 18 Balaam i peroveta wona:  
\q1 “Balak, ke bomsiri, ba ki tainabaenega,  
\q2 Zippor natuna ke nonoriku.   
\q1
\v 19 God wai kega pipiya mom kata ita kwaruma,  
\q2 kona pipiya mom natusi kata ana nota ita birai.  
\q1 Meyana i sisiya ba kega i wosei?  
\q2 Meyana i kaobiyoyobanim ba kega i wosei?   
\q1
\v 20 I kaotuneiku ani gairena,  
\q2 ba kona i gairenisi ba kega rubana ani neveramagei.   
\q1
\v 21 Kega goyona Jacob ana rakaraka kamonai  
\q2 kega goyona sina paiwarei Israel kamonai,  
\q2 kairavina \nd Bada\nd* asi God kosi yabata,  
\q2 si yoneyonei kona asi taupauma kamosi yai.   
\q1
\v 22 Egypt yai God i yaunisi si kasibau,  
\q2 asi maragata garaga bull rutainina.   
\q1
\v 23 Kairapu kega rubana Jacob ina bowai,  
\q2 kega rubana sina pasiri  
\q1 Jacob ba Israel sini sisiyisi,  
\q2 ‘Ko kinani awaika God i wose!’   
\q1
\v 24 Nikosi dam lion bibituwana rutainina te kokona  
\q2 kega tema binubaisi yepo  
\q2 kasi sirage te bowabowai ba tarana te tomatomani.”   
\c 24  
\q1
\v 17 “A kinani, saba kega karaku;  
\q2 A kitakitai saba kega gwabiku ai  
\q1 Jacob karinai gwamegwame ina kasibau  
\q2 ba Israel karisi yai ana nimakona putuputu ina kasibau  
\q1 Moab nao bakobakosi ina guda  
\q2 ba Seth natunatuna gayamisi ini kasigaoworana.   
\q1
\v 18 Edom sina yauni,  
\q2 ba kasi abiya Seir, sina getawani,  
\q2 saba Israel ini maragata.   
\q1
\v 19 Jacob karinai kaiwabo ina kasibau,  
\q2 ba pipiya si ma boterisi wai ina kasibigoyonisi.”   
\c 25  
\s1 Moab Israel i Sakari  
\p
\v 1 Israel biyisi Shittim meyaginai si mamana wai, sebasebare si dagui Moab bibaine yabata si raukaipara.  
\v 2 Si yorisi asi god kurina si puyopuyo bunuwa. Ba sibi kam poragana ba asi god si bopepetei.  
\v 3  \nd Bada\nd* i yagisi saki kurisi kairavina Israel kurisi mena si kapu ba Peor asi god Baal si bopepetei.   
\p
\v 4  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona, “Nikosi pipiya asi babada ereonowasi ke yaunisi ba ki kasibunuwana ba kao ai matakuai, ki debisi kata kega Bada ini yagisi saki Israel biyisi kurisi.”   
\p
\v 5 Kata Moses Israel asi bibuibuiya biyisi si wonisi, “Komi iyabomi wata ami pipiya gaburimi yai, si kapu ba Peor asi god Baal te bopepetei wai, koi kasibunuwana.”   
\p
\v 6 Moses ba Israel biyisi ereonowasi Tabernacle matam ketanai si tutou ba matasi yai Israel sebare midian wasike i urabai i botu ana rakaraka kurisi.  
\v 7 Maranai Eleazar natuna Phinehas Aaron wawana kona wai priest,  
\v 8 ba nikona i kinani wai koroto i kasibau taveyei ba yaronai ana iyo i yauni sebarena i kibi i riu ana ku gweda ba i yowa wai asi ruwamo i tupa kokonisi sebare ba wasike, kata Israel biyisi kasi gubaga i kakaba,  
\v 9 saba matapa pipiya asi 24,000 si rabobo.   
\p
\v 10  \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona,  
\v 11 “Eleazar natuna Phinehas kona wai priest ba Aaron wawana, au yagisi Israel biyisi gwabisi yai i tere sirei, kona yauku bokuwaiku kairavina i nuwarauwa kosi kamosi yai, kata au waina ata wosei wai kega a wosei.  
\v 12 Karaku ke wonei kata au nuwanuba bidamanina maragasina kurina ana wosei.  
\v 13 Niko bidamanina maragasina kamonai, kona ba ana rakaraka mara murinai te botubotu wai priest saibirina kamosi yai ina madamana, kairavina ana God kana waba bokuwayina kairavina i nuwarauwa ba Israel biyisi asi goyona i maisa taveyei.”   
\c 27  
\s1 God Joshua i Binei  
\p
\v 18 Kata \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona, “Nun natuna Joshua\x * \xo 27:18 \xt Exodus 24:13\x* au kanuma i bonuwei wai ke yauni ba yarom ku gayamina ke terei.  
\v 19 Ke botuwei priest Eleazar ba pipiya ereonowasi naosi yai ini misiri ba kuni yonayona kata karaku, kona pipiya ini naovisi.  
\v 20 Am bibadana maragasina mutuna ki garubonei kurina kata Israel biyisi ereonowasi sina bosisirei.  
\v 21 Kona wai priest Eleazar naoni i nimsiri ba kona kairavina Urim ina toirubai awaika wata \nd Bada\nd* naonai ina wose. Kata kona ina kaotuneisi wai Israel biyisi ereonowasi sina kasibau ba yebo sina riu.”   
\p
\v 22 Moses mekabage \nd Bada\nd* i kaotunei wai i wosei. Joshua i yauni ba priest Eleazar ba Israel biyisi ereonowasi naosi yai i msiri.  
\v 23 Damanina ba yarona gayamina tepanai i terei ba i yoneyonei \nd Bada\nd* Moses i kaobiyoyobani wai nanakasike.   
\c 33  
\s1 Kaobiyoyobana Jordan Bigarubonina kairavina  
\p
\v 50 Moab guburinai Jordan okowina parinai ba Jericho sepinai si kwanatu maranai, Bada Moses kurina i wona,  
\v 51 “Israel biyisi kurisi nikasike ki sisiya, ‘Maranai Jordan okowina koni gagubonei ku Canaan wai,  
\v 52 pipiya ereonowasi kona kupurinai te mamana wai ko kwabinisi sina kasibau. Asi tarabibisaka tebo pepeta ba asi bopepeta gawarisi koi kasi rikeyana.  
\v 53 Ba tano ko yauni ba namai ko kwanatu kairavina a berimi ini karimi yai.  
\v 54 Tanona aba binebinena ami dam nununai koi yapara owaowa. Koroto kaikapona wai yapara kaikapona ko berisi ba koroto yogiyogina wai yapara yogiyogina ko berisi. Ba kotoi aba binebinena sini garui ba ina binei wai karinai. Ami dam nununai koi yabei.  
\v 55 Pipiya namai te mamana wai kega kona kwabinsi ba kona boterisi sina mana wai matami sini siwa gaoworana ba ruriruri rutainina gabagabami sini siwa kwariyana. Ba kupurinai kona mana wai kosi sini abiyimi.  
\v 56 Ba kega kona kwabinisi sina kasibau wai mekabage a nosinosi ata kasibigoyonisi wai komi nakasike ana kasibigoyonimi.’”   
\c 35  
\s1 Bosusura Meyagisi  
\p
\v 9 Ba \nd Bada\nd* Moses kurina i wona,  
\v 10 “Maranai Jordan koni garubonei ku Canaan wa,  
\v 11 meyaga mutusi ke bineisi kata bosusura meyagisi, memena bage pipiya kega ana waina pipiya ita kasibunui saba i kasibunui wai ina vera kona ku mayagina ina bosusura.  
\v 12 Kosi meyagisi wai aba kobakoba gawarisi, biuwa yaunina kairavina pipiyina kega ina bosusura. Kata kasibunuwa biyina kega ina rabobo ba koroto ai, sina kai bibuibuiyei.”   